1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,425
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:07,007
This is Episode 20.

3
00:00:07,007 --> 00:00:09,720
Eddie can run one job.

4
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:14,348
Sometimes the town needs many little jobs at once.

5
00:00:14,348 --> 00:00:17,686
So we pack them in toy boxes!

6
00:00:17,686 --> 00:00:19,627
Meet Boxy.

7
00:00:19,627 --> 00:00:22,327
Boxy is E C S.

8
00:00:22,327 --> 00:00:24,800
A cream toy box.

9
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:29,773
Many little Eddies play inside, and the box runs them.

10
00:00:29,773 --> 00:00:31,675
Meet Kira.

11
00:00:31,675 --> 00:00:34,454
Kira is E K S.

12
00:00:34,454 --> 00:00:37,912
She is the captain of the toy boxes.

13
00:00:37,912 --> 00:00:41,329
She lines them up the Kubernetes way.

14
00:00:41,329 --> 00:00:43,031
Meet Fay.

15
00:00:43,031 --> 00:00:45,331
Fay is Fargate.

16
00:00:45,331 --> 00:00:47,978
She is a flying box.

17
00:00:47,978 --> 00:00:50,731
No Eddie has to hold her.

18
00:00:50,731 --> 00:00:53,071
She runs herself.

19
00:00:53,071 --> 00:00:55,797
Boxy can sit on Eddie.

20
00:00:55,797 --> 00:00:59,348
Kira can captain lots of boxes.

21
00:00:59,348 --> 00:01:01,953
Fay can fly for both.

22
00:01:01,953 --> 00:01:03,989
Pack the toys.

23
00:01:03,989 --> 00:01:05,890
Pick a box.

24
00:01:05,890 --> 00:01:08,058
They work together.

25
00:01:08,058 --> 00:01:11,143
Now you know the toy boxes!

26
00:01:11,143 --> 00:01:15,837
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

